   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Welcome to The Kitchen, a Russian comedy set in the kitchen of Claude Monet, a smart French restaurant in Moscow. Barinov is the loud head chef, Max the newest cook, and Kostya the bartender who is Max's best friend. In this episode a secret restaurant critic is expected, and nobody knows who he is. It starts quietly, at the bar, where Max and Kostya ask who really runs the place. You'll hear it first, and you don't need to catch every word.",
   "gap": 0.8
